---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Keep this date current whenever the substance of the policy changes.
const lastUpdated = 'October 3, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | K & A Performance"
  description="How K & A Performance collects, uses, and shares information on this site, including form submissions, text messages (SMS), AI chat, and advertising pixels."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-16 md:pt-48">
    <p data-animate="type-settle" class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">
      Legal
    </p>
    <h1 data-animate="type-settle" data-animate-delay="0.1" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.02]">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p data-animate="type-settle" data-animate-delay="0.2" class="mt-6 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
      Last updated {lastUpdated}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-32 md:pb-40">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          K &amp; A Performance is a web design and AI integration studio based in Florida. This
          policy explains what information <strong class="text-ink">ka-performancefl.com</strong>
          collects, why, and who it is shared with. This includes enquiries, optional advertising
          measurement, AI tools, and free course signup and learning features.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Information you give us</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          When you use our contact, project, AI Launch or training enquiry forms, we collect what
          you type into it: your name, email address, phone number where requested, and any company name, service interest,
          budget range, or project details you choose to share. These submissions are delivered to
          us by <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Resend</a>,
          an email delivery service that passes the message to our business inbox. We use it to reply to
          you and to keep ordinary business records of the enquiry. We do not sell it, and we do not
          add you to a mailing list.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Free course and optional learning analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Course signup collects your email and any first name you provide. It is stored in Cloudflare D1 and sent through Resend to our business inbox. The signup includes occasional emails, as described beside the form; each includes an unsubscribe link. Enquiry forms do not subscribe you to that list.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If you separately accept Analytics, the interactive first-session course sends chapter views and completions to our course database. Where the course access cookie contains a signup token, those events can be linked to your course signup. Rejecting or withdrawing analytics stops new events and keeps your access and saved local progress. It does not delete earlier records or unsubscribe you from emails.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="sms" class="scroll-mt-28">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Text messages (SMS)</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          If you give us a mobile number and ask us in writing to text you, we use that number to
          send customer care messages about your appointment, your enquiry, or your project:
          scheduling, confirmations, reschedules and reminders, replies to what you asked, project
          updates, and invoice or billing notices. We do not send marketing or promotional text
          messages, and agreeing to texts is never a condition of buying anything from us. We do
          not treat a phone number entered on an enquiry form as permission to send texts.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          We keep a record of the number, the consent you gave, and the date you gave it, because
          telecoms rules require us to be able to show that you asked to be texted. To stop, reply
          <strong class="text-ink">STOP</strong> to any message from us, or email
          <a href="mailto:alex@ka-performancefl.com" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">alex@ka-performancefl.com</a>.
          Reply <strong class="text-ink">HELP</strong> for help. Message frequency varies, and
          message and data rates may apply. The full program terms are on our
          <a href="/terms/#sms" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
          page.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          To send those messages we use
          <a href="https://www.twilio.com/en-us/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Twilio</a>,
          a messaging provider that delivers the text to your mobile carrier on our behalf and
          processes your number only for that purpose. Your mobile carrier also handles the message
          in order to deliver it.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          <strong class="text-ink">No mobile information will be shared with third parties or
          affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> All other categories of data
          sharing described in this policy exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and
          consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties. We do not sell mobile
          numbers, and we do not use them for anything other than the customer care messages
          described above.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">AI chat on this site</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Some pages offer a chat assistant that answers questions about our work and helps scope a
          project. The messages you type are sent to
          <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Anthropic</a>
          to generate a reply, and the reply is returned to your browser. The site guide endpoint
          does not write chat conversations to our database. This does not describe provider or
          infrastructure logs or their retention. Please do not type sensitive personal information, passwords,
          or confidential material into the chat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Voice demo</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If you choose Start talking in the services-page voice demo, the site connects to ElevenLabs and asks for microphone access. Audio you provide is sent to ElevenLabs for the conversation. Do not share sensitive or confidential information. Ending the call stops that conversation; it does not promise deletion of provider records.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Advertising measurement (Meta pixel)</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          If you accept Marketing in Privacy choices, this site loads Meta pixel technology to
          measure how our advertising performs. Before that choice, it does not load the pixel or
          send its events. The pixel
          records that a page was viewed and that a contact form was completed, along with standard
          technical information such as your browser, device, and IP address, and it may set or read
          cookies. Meta handles information it receives under its own privacy policy. We do not
          send enquiry field values to Meta through our Lead event.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          You can control how this information is used for advertising through your
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/adpreferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Facebook ad preferences</a>,
          and through Meta&rsquo;s
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">privacy policy</a>.
          Browser settings, tracking protection, and ad blockers will also prevent the pixel from
          loading, and the site works normally without it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Information collected automatically</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site is hosted on
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Cloudflare</a>,
          which keeps standard server and security logs (including IP addresses) to serve pages and
          protect against abuse. Our public Google reviews are fetched from the Google Places API by
          our server; that request contains no information about you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          The ka_privacy cookie remembers your choices for up to 180 days. After Marketing is
          accepted, ka_src can remember the referring partner for up to 90 days and is used with
          a later enquiry or course signup. Meta may set its own advertising cookies. The ka_course
          cookie lasts up to one year, is renewed when you access course pages, and keeps the requested
          course available. Course progress and practice notes can be saved in your browser's local
          storage. Those learning features do not require analytics or marketing permission.
          Cloudflare can also use necessary security cookies. Cookie lifetimes do not specify
          how long business records or provider logs are retained.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to
          delete it. Email <a href="mailto:alex@ka-performancefl.com" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">alex@ka-performancefl.com</a>
          so we can review your request. Open <button type="button" data-privacy-open class="text-accent underline">Privacy choices</button>
          to accept, reject, customize or withdraw optional analytics and marketing. Rejecting
          these does not stop enquiry forms, course access or the AI tools you choose to use.
          Withdrawing Marketing reloads the page to stop the loaded pixel and removes its
          accessible first-party cookies and our referral cookie. Save unfinished form text first.
          This does not recall information already sent. You can stop our text messages at any time by replying
          <strong class="text-ink">STOP</strong>. You can also decline to use the forms or chat
          entirely, and browse the site with tracking protection enabled.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site is intended for businesses and adults. We do not knowingly collect information
          from children.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Changes and contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          If this policy changes in substance, we will update the date at the top of this page.
          Questions about any of it can go to
          <a href="mailto:alex@ka-performancefl.com" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">alex@ka-performancefl.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
